          "thread": "Crypto debit card buildout",
          "why": "The MetaMask card EU/UK pilot and Mercuryo self-custodial card showed readers that spending crypto at 100M+ merchants via Mastercard rails is no longer hypothetical, making this the most concrete use-case story."
